            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Stopp"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Strain and heart-rate zones are measured against it. If you know yours from a test, set it here." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Belastung und Herzfrequenzzonen richten sich danach. Wenn du deinen Wert aus einem Test kennst, kannst du ihn hier einstellen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Strain comes from the heart rate your tracker syncs for this time. Without it, your effort rating is used." : {
      "comment" : "Add activity: where an activity's strain comes from.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Belastung basiert auf den Herzfrequenzdaten, die dein Tracker für diesen Zeitraum synchronisiert. Ohne diese Daten zählt deine Einschätzung."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Strain pending" : {
      "comment" : "My Day row: at RYFT, strain not scored yet.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Belastung ausstehend"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Streams" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Datenströme"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Strength is best logged in Train." : {
      "comment" : "Add activity: the collapsed Strength suggestion.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Erfasse Krafttraining am besten unter „Trainieren“."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Strength is best logged in Train. Your sets, reps and load count toward muscular load." : {
      "comment" : "Add activity and detail: Strength belongs in Train.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Erfasse Krafttraining unter „Trainieren“. Sätze, Wiederholungen und Gewichte fließen in die muskuläre Belastung ein."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switches between estimated 1RM, estimated 10RM and RPE" : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver hint on the set table's fourth column header in a workout.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wechselt zwischen geschätztem 1RM, geschätztem 10RM und RPE"
