    "Tell me when my first scores are ready" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Benachrichtige mich, wenn meine ersten Werte vorliegen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tell RYFT what you wear to see how to set up your data." : {
      "comment" : "Devices & sync when no tracker is chosen.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gib an, welches Gerät du trägst. RYFT zeigt dir, wie du deine Daten einrichtest."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tell RYFT when you want to wake up. It tells you when to go to bed, with what today's strain and your sleep debt add." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lege fest, wann du aufstehen willst. RYFT schlägt eine Schlafenszeit vor und berücksichtigt die heutige Belastung und deinen Schlafrückstand."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thanks, your report reached RYFT." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Danke. Deine Meldung ist bei RYFT angekommen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That's faster than expected for this sport. Check the distance." : {
      "comment" : "Add activity: the average speed is implausible (a warning; Save stays enabled).",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Das Tempo ist für diese Sportart ungewöhnlich hoch. Prüfe die Distanz."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That's normal." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Das ist üblich."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The %lld workouts you logged with Demo data will be discarded. This can't be undone." : {
      "comment" : "The count includes one in progress. They're deleted from this iPhone; they only ever reached the demo's sample platform.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "The workout you logged with Demo data will be discarded. This can't be undone."
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
