          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Uhrzeit des Aufwachens"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Times are kept as written in the file and shown in %@." : {
      "comment" : "Training import, step 5: the zone; its identifier, e.g. Europe/Berlin.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Uhrzeiten bleiben wie in der Datei und werden für %@ angezeigt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To calculate your scores, RYFT processes health data from Apple Health. Here is what that means." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "RYFT verarbeitet Gesundheitsdaten aus Apple Health, um deine Werte zu berechnen. Hier erfährst du, was das bedeutet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To check what RYFT may read:" : {
      "comment" : "Heading over the steps to RYFT's own Health permission.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "So prüfst du, was RYFT lesen darf:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Today · %@" : {
      "comment" : "My Day's header under \"My Day\": today, then its date (\"Wed, Nov 18\").",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Heute · %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "today.ruler.high" : {
      "comment" : "Scale word under Today's readiness ruler, lower case: the high band (67 and up).",
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
