      "comment" : "OrbitGauge VoiceOver: strain above the day's recommended range, e.g. 'Strain 16.5 of 21, above today's recommended range 8 to 13'. Said instead of the sibling sentence when the arc has turned red, so the colour is not the only signal. The range is the platform's recommendation, not a goal the user sets: don't translate it as Ziel. Not reached in the app until the platform serves the range (docs/API_REQUESTS.md, Charts and gauges #2). Arguments in order: strain, range start, range end.",
