    },
    "Which screens and features are used, including food search, logging and Sync now, with counts and timings as ranges; onboarding progress; errors shown with their status codes; and when the app is opened or closed, with the app and iOS version and the device type." : {
      "comment" : "Analytics prompt: the first point (what is sent). Names food search, logging and Sync now; never the foods, queries or amounts.",
